# Mutable solver state for one distance joint during prepare/warm-start/
# solve, kept as a scratch record so the per-block solver helpers stay
# within method complexity limits. Mirrors the local variables of upstream
# b2SolveDistanceJoint.
Class DistanceJointScratch
## Linear velocity of body A.
Property VAX As Double
## Y component of body A's linear velocity.
Property VAY As Double
## Angular velocity of body A.
Property WA As Double
## X component of body B's linear velocity.
Property VBX As Double
## Y component of body B's linear velocity.
Property VBY As Double
## Angular velocity of body B.
Property WB As Double
## X component of the rotated anchor on body A.
Property RAX As Double
## Y component of the rotated anchor on body A.
Property RAY As Double
## X component of the rotated anchor on body B.
Property RBX As Double
## Y component of the rotated anchor on body B.
Property RBY As Double
## X component of the unit separation axis.
Property AxisX As Double
## Y component of the unit separation axis.
Property AxisY As Double
## Current anchor separation length.
Property Length As Double

## Creates a zeroed scratch record.
Constructor()
Me.VAX = 0.0
Me.VAY = 0.0
Me.WA = 0.0
Me.VBX = 0.0
Me.VBY = 0.0
Me.WB = 0.0
Me.RAX = 0.0
Me.RAY = 0.0
Me.RBX = 0.0
Me.RBY = 0.0
Me.AxisX = 0.0
Me.AxisY = 0.0
Me.Length = 0.0
End Constructor
End Class
